title: Prisoners and the Cheka
card-image: img/cards/judiciary.svg?v=2
subtitle: Campaign for the arrested socialists.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: soviet_affairs
view-if: judiciary_timer <= 0 and dix >= 26
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; judiciary_timer = 3

The Cheka was created in December 1917. Every month it arrests socialists of the other parties, sometimes dozens at a time. Our members are among them. (Repression: [+ repression : level +].)

- @public: Launch a public campaign for the prisoners.
- @quiet: Use our contacts among the moderate Bolsheviks.
- @abroad: Ask European socialists to demand their release.
- @easy_discard

@public

How should the party go about it? Cautiously, with compromises, it will cost a resource, do less and anger less. In full, it will do all that it says, and its opponents will answer. And a party strong enough can carry it out and break its opponents.

- @public_slow: Go about it cautiously, with compromises.
- @public_decree: Carry it out in full.
- @public_force: Carry it out in full, and break any opposition by force.

@public_slow
choose-if: resources >= 1
subtitle: Milder effects and little anger. Costs 1 resource.
unavailable-subtitle: We have nothing to pay the compensation with.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'slow', () => {
RO.add(Q, {repression: -3, rel_bol: -3, soviet_democracy: 2});
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 3, middle: 2});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 1, -2);
if (Q.repression >= 30 && Q.legality > 1) { Q.legality -= 1; }
}, "Launch a public campaign for the prisoners");
!}

A public campaign for the prisoners filled our meetings with relatives. Some were released. Some of those who organised it were not. (It was done cautiously, with compromises.)



@public_decree
subtitle: All that it says. Its opponents will answer.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'decree', () => {
RO.add(Q, {repression: -3, rel_bol: -3, soviet_democracy: 2});
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 3, middle: 2});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 1, -2);
if (Q.repression >= 30 && Q.legality > 1) { Q.legality -= 1; }
}, "Launch a public campaign for the prisoners");
!}

A public campaign for the prisoners filled our meetings with relatives. Some were released. Some of those who organised it were not.



@public_force
view-if: bol_regime = 0
choose-if: strength >= 18
subtitle: Your chance of breaking each camp it angers: Bolsheviks [+ odds_bol +]%. Any camp under 45% is too strong for you, and is left alone.
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the force and the allies to break the opposition.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'force', () => {
RO.add(Q, {repression: -3, rel_bol: -3, soviet_democracy: 2});
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 3, middle: 2});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 1, -2);
if (Q.repression >= 30 && Q.legality > 1) { Q.legality -= 1; }
}, "Launch a public campaign for the prisoners");
!}

A public campaign for the prisoners filled our meetings with relatives. Some were released. Some of those who organised it were not. [+ law_text +]

@quiet
choose-if: rel_bol >= 35
unavailable-subtitle: We are no longer on speaking terms with enough Bolsheviks.
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {repression: -3, rel_bol: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 1, -2);
Q.prisoners_freed = (Q.prisoners_freed || 0) + 1;
!}

A few Bolshevik friends interceded for us, without publicity. A few prisoners were released.

@abroad
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {repression: -2, soviet_democracy: 1});
Q.foreign_pressure = (Q.foreign_pressure || 0) + 1;
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', 1, -1);
!}

The International sent protests, and the British Labour Party offered to send a delegation. It is hard to shoot a man who is in the foreign press.
